Project Name: Young Hero

Tool 1: Number Guessing Game
This tool allows the user to guess a secret number between 1 and 10 until they guess correctly.

Tool 2: To-Do List
This tool allows the user to add tasks, view tasks, and remove tasks using a list.

Tool 3: Simple Calculator
This tool allows the user to calculate the sum, difference, product, or division of two numbers.

